        "content": "<p>Pop quiz: What would you expect this to output?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">show</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Except</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mut</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">try</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">throw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"oops\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">catch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">()</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
