        "content": "<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<p>It outputs <code>.ok 1</code></p>\n<p>If <code>mut</code> is trying to emulate imperative code, I would have expected the mutations to persist beyond <code>try</code> blocks. </p>\n</div></div>",
