    {
        "content": "<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>Spoiler</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<p>The answer seems to be consistent with the documentation of <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Alternative#doc\">docs#Alternative</a> (which implements try / catch if I am not mistaken), talking about backtracking / error recovery</p>\n</div></div>",
